          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erasing really gives you a new identity" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刪除之後真的會換一個新身分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "錯誤"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every field in your document: name, ID number, date of birth, household address and nationality. This version cannot show only part of it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "證件裡的每一個欄位：姓名、統一編號、出生日期、戶籍地址與國籍。這個版本無法只出示其中一部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every time you show this document it reveals the same identifier. Different checkers can compare notes and tell it was you both times." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這份證件每次出示都會露出同一組識別碼。不同的查驗者只要互相比對，就能看出兩次都是你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excluded from backup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已排除備份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expected here — there is no Secure Enclave to use." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這裡本來就是這樣——沒有安全隔離區可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Field named by their document: “%@”" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
